  "unit": "Possession, with stint boundaries defined by the rotation intervals; comparison pairs formed within game, period and clock window.",
  "sample": "2022-23, 2023-24 and 2024-25 regular season and playoffs, from the NBA stats play-by-play, rotation intervals and starters files. Exclude bonus and foul-trouble windows, end-of-period and timeout-adjacent possessions as a pre-specified sensitivity analysis. Playoffs reported separately.",
