  "controls": "Shooter fixed effects; game, period and clock fixed effects; score margin and possession number; foul counts; timeout indicators; team-season FE; lineup-team-season FE as a sensitivity analysis; a substitution-reason proxy where available. Derived play-type labels to be audited against raw action type and sub-type on a random sample before use.",
